icts + auditor rerun"}], "report_six_sections": "tensor_reports id=16985: ①..⑥ present, 1 embedded figure, explicit '<3%: NO / <15%: PASS' answer", "audit_independence": "auditor mission 18151; no edits to m18101 worktree; reruns executed from /tmp scratch copy against work/m18101/src"}$json$, 'board-audit')
